{"suttaId":"an6.33","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-vi","vriCode":"s0403m2.mul","paras":[235,238],"vripara":"33"},"segments":{"an6.33:0.3":"Dutiyaaparihānasuttaṃ","an6.33:1.1":"“Imaṃ, bhikkhave, rattiṃ aññatarā devatā abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkantavaṇṇā kevalakappaṃ jetavanaṃ obhāsetvā yenāhaṃ tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā maṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhāsi. Ekamantaṃ ṭhitā kho, bhikkhave, sā devatā maṃ etadavoca –","an6.33:1.2":"‘chayime, bhante, dhammā bhikkhuno aparihānāya saṃvattanti.","an6.33:1.3":"Katame cha?","an6.33:1.4":"Satthugāravatā, dhammagāravatā, saṅghagāravatā, sikkhāgāravatā, hirigāravatā, ottappagāravatā – ime kho, bhante, cha dhammā bhikkhuno aparihānāya saṃvattantī’ti.","an6.33:1.6":"Idamavoca, bhikkhave, sā devatā.","an6.33:1.7":"Idaṃ vatvā maṃ abhivādetvā padakkhiṇaṃ katvā tatthevantaradhāyī”ti.","an6.33:2.1":"“Satthugaru dhammagaru, saṅghe ca tibbagāravo;","an6.33:2.3":"Hiriottappasampanno, sappatisso sagāravo;","an6.33:2.5":"Abhabbo parihānāya, nibbānasseva santike”ti.","an6.33:2.7":"tatiyaṃ;"},"attha":{"book":"Mp-vi","bookName":"Chakkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":590,"to":591,"paras":[{"para":590,"vripara":"32-33","refs":["an6.33:1"],"lines":["32-33. Dutiye <b>satthugāravatā</b>ti satthari garubhāvo.","<b>Dhammagāravatā</b>ti navavidhe lokuttaradhamme garubhāvo.","<b>Saṅghagāravatā</b>ti saṅghe garubhāvo.","<b>Sikkhāgāravatā</b>ti tīsu sikkhāsu garubhāvo.","<b>Appamādagāravatā</b>ti appamāde garubhāvo.","<b>Paṭisanthāragāravatā</b>ti dhammāmisavasena duvidhe paṭisanthāre garubhāvo.","Satthā garu assāti <b>satthugaru</b>.","Dhammo garu assāti <b>dhammagaru.</b>","<b>Tibbagāravo</b>ti bahalagāravo.","Paṭisanthāre gāravo assāti <b>paṭisanthāragāravo</b>.","Tatiye <b>sappatisso</b>ti sajeṭṭhako sagāravo.","Hirottappaṃ panettha missakaṃ kathitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"]]},{"para":591,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.33:1"],"lines":["Mahāmoggallānasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an6.33:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-vi","bookName":"Chakkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":586,"to":588,"paras":[{"para":586,"vripara":"31-34","refs":["an6.33:1"],"lines":["31-34. Catutthassa paṭhame sekhānaṃ paṭiladdhaguṇassa parihāni nāma natthīti āha <b>“uparūpariguṇaparihānāyā”</b>ti, uparūpariladdhabbānaṃ maggaphalānaṃ parihānāya anuppādāyāti attho.","Tatiyādīni uttānatthāneva."],"lineRefs":[["an6.33:1"],["an6.33:1"]]},{"para":587,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sekhasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":588,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.33:1"],"lines":["Vijjābhāgiyasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an6.33:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]}}
